{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "NSFW Porn detection microservice", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3548a49de068c5b62d5d5aaa4ae6b490ebd86427836b4ef4ebdb521dc396c802.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.82], [2, 1.2, 1.64], [3, 1.64, 2.4]]}, {"text": "I built a low-cost NSFW API hosted on Digital Ocean’s new App Platform.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/81d189ac16e606f125d78476dc2552084ac20f0dbddef636cd12901fa79085cd.mp3"}, {"text": "Updated: Added second model: Bumble’s private_detector", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a5c082b93559e8d2683711ba367452a101abdb3cf3a12d261e2df8dd3b6baa61.mp3"}, {"text": "I added Bumble’s Private Detector to the model host so both models can be leveraged.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/63888f2c9fbc30008a80fa537681592299ab84f67422d518c24df22972bed468.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.98], [3, 0.98, 1.24], [4, 1.24, 1.7], [5, 1.7, 1.9], [6, 1.9, 2.02], [7, 2.02, 2.22], [8, 2.22, 2.56], [9, 2.56, 2.8], [10, 2.8, 3.1], [11, 3.1, 3.44], [12, 3.44, 3.66], [13, 3.66, 3.78], [14, 3.78, 4.28]]}, {"text": "Both models can be hosted on FlyIO’s low-cost servers for about $25/mo.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/26b432a8e4d611af863a1690f94a45969154b6fb63b798bec4190aa7be4aa99e.mp3"}, {"text": "How do image tagging ML models work?", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ca0f89e747c633d1fadadb1b116613900395627d928e9114114634d65fa1123f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.38], [5, 1.64, 1.96], [6, 1.96, 2.32]]}, {"text": "Making predictions based on images involves two basic steps: training the data and then processing the prediction.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/035f899b7119cc782a33b5292617619b33b4f12427bddbd24a9755ef4098dda7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.94], [2, 0.94, 1.38], [3, 1.38, 1.56], [4, 1.56, 1.92], [5, 1.92, 2.42], [6, 2.42, 2.76], [7, 2.76, 3.06], [8, 3.06, 3.56], [9, 4.16, 4.36], [10, 4.36, 4.56], [11, 4.56, 4.82], [12, 4.82, 5.12], [13, 5.12, 5.24], [14, 5.24, 5.7], [15, 5.7, 5.98], [16, 5.98, 6.34]]}, {"text": "How to train the ML model can be found in the Github repo: GantMan/nsfw_model.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f3b0a42a8c493c265a2cc7b313be308a6a6071f4286b911c6cd7b6d64f6183b1.mp3"}, {"text": "The prediction API first fetches the remote image and saves the bytes to disk.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/abfc5683a0d1b13b61ab5875c1c9ee8223ff117d0cc2870b4390a895fb4e71e3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 1.0], [3, 1.0, 1.38], [4, 1.38, 1.74], [5, 1.74, 1.9], [6, 1.9, 2.1], [7, 2.1, 2.46], [8, 2.46, 2.66], [9, 2.66, 2.84], [10, 2.84, 3.04], [11, 3.04, 3.22], [12, 3.22, 3.42], [13, 3.42, 3.78]]}, {"text": "Persisting to disk simplifies communicating with the ML library since the library accepts a file path, not a byte stream.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b77b6d922ed687b87293e700274866b01b184e5859150e1028153add34e557a6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.56], [1, 0.56, 0.72], [3, 0.92, 1.58], [4, 1.58, 2.2], [5, 2.2, 2.48], [6, 2.48, 2.62], [7, 2.62, 2.78], [8, 2.78, 3.32], [9, 3.32, 3.74], [10, 3.74, 3.98], [11, 3.98, 4.4], [12, 4.4, 4.8], [13, 4.8, 5.06], [14, 5.06, 5.32], [15, 5.32, 5.74], [16, 5.86, 6.04], [17, 6.04, 6.18], [18, 6.18, 6.32], [19, 6.32, 6.68]]}, {"text": "Then the image is resized to fit the dimensions of the ML model.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/417873c88bde77f4b014f202abeb3bc404b3739d4f2b28688c27a8e8734e6fb6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.52], [6, 1.52, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 1.84], [8, 1.84, 2.18], [9, 2.18, 2.48], [10, 2.48, 2.62], [11, 2.62, 2.82], [12, 2.82, 3.16]]}, {"text": "The ML algorithm needs to compare apples to apples and so resizing to match the same size of the image training data is critical for developing the right comparison.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c878af9aea853b815dbd7d8feb4bf87ab5a5bacdda85dec12ba555a095cf0e04.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.92], [3, 0.92, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 1.4], [5, 1.4, 1.7], [6, 1.7, 2.04], [7, 2.04, 2.34], [8, 2.34, 2.66], [9, 2.66, 2.92], [10, 2.92, 3.06], [11, 3.06, 3.56], [12, 3.56, 3.86], [14, 4.02, 4.26], [15, 4.26, 4.54], [16, 4.54, 4.78], [17, 4.78, 5.0], [18, 5.0, 5.1], [19, 5.1, 5.3], [20, 5.3, 5.64], [21, 5.64, 6.0], [22, 6.0, 6.18], [23, 6.18, 6.46], [24, 6.46, 6.7], [25, 6.7, 7.08], [26, 7.08, 7.28], [27, 7.28, 7.44], [28, 7.44, 7.96]]}, {"text": "The resized image is categorized using the attached model.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/57312dbcdfc218cd88ac64cc01e69810e7883b8977162948a4b77d3b17a7290b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.64], [2, 0.64, 0.94], [3, 0.94, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 2.04], [5, 2.04, 2.26], [6, 2.26, 2.44], [7, 2.44, 2.68], [8, 2.68, 3.1]]}, {"text": "This provides a float score for each of the categories: drawings, hentai, neutral, porn, and sexy.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/435e936ee6f8be1a15d498459695ed68f9e8c1b41feb0f2036a39ed10d90200b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.72], [3, 0.72, 0.9], [4, 0.9, 1.2], [5, 1.2, 1.42], [6, 1.42, 1.6], [7, 1.6, 1.7], [8, 1.7, 1.82], [9, 1.82, 2.3], [10, 2.9, 3.16], [12, 4.54, 5.08], [13, 5.52, 5.92], [14, 6.18, 6.44], [15, 6.44, 6.8]]}, {"text": "The higher the score, the more likely the image is in this category.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/df8adc30a3a34698f19df9e2a46e87ee0bf0e2914d499868a713120b17729562.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.98], [4, 1.4, 1.44], [5, 1.44, 1.6], [6, 1.6, 1.9], [7, 1.9, 2.12], [8, 2.12, 2.34], [9, 2.34, 2.62], [10, 2.62, 2.74], [11, 2.74, 2.92], [12, 2.92, 3.34]]}, {"text": "Once the prediction is created, we clean up after ourselves by deleting the image from the disk and return the response.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/af1be4a8c44629a0a72bd466d4096ddcf6583132aca9b0ac4f88194542c81c4f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.4], [5, 1.7, 1.78], [6, 1.78, 2.02], [7, 2.02, 2.18], [8, 2.18, 2.46], [9, 2.46, 2.86], [10, 2.86, 3.1], [11, 3.1, 3.38], [12, 3.38, 3.7], [13, 3.7, 3.9], [14, 3.9, 4.1], [15, 4.1, 4.24], [17, 4.48, 4.7], [18, 4.7, 4.94], [19, 4.94, 5.1], [20, 5.1, 5.42]]}, {"text": "On the client, these scores are converted to 3 states:", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b22cb7b0540c20414d0de2e6fe75d4247eaa0bfff681083c8ed2543d30dab907.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.64], [5, 1.18, 1.34], [6, 1.34, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 1.88], [9, 2.1, 2.42]]}, {"text": "Definitely Adult Content", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f66df19ab6b45360c1efa0f72cb5d0d15dc94fbb30a87243c6edb4a250b156ca.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.48], [1, 0.48, 0.84], [2, 0.84, 1.32]]}, {"text": "Unknown", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/912fc8c43ab390c02372e9da7dcb77473427cbb000439869e262fbcd42096973.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.58]]}, {"text": "Definitely Safe Content", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7aa105c2f276a00124e160f73f53e93f8333b68c131a03d79c86bc6ddc43b595.mp3"}, {"text": "The unknown state will need to be human-reviewed and bucketed into one of the “definite” categories.", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5069cb327aa37b85d5a6a6b0b353a1bfb9235cc2123a0d73c5a90f6d92e328ee.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.98], [3, 0.98, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 1.38], [5, 1.38, 1.54], [6, 1.54, 1.64], [8, 2.66, 2.86], [9, 2.86, 3.32], [10, 3.32, 3.64], [11, 3.64, 3.86], [12, 3.86, 3.98], [13, 3.98, 4.1], [14, 4.1, 4.52], [15, 4.52, 5.12]]}, {"text": "For my first pass, I use a combination of “sexy” and “porn” scores to determine if it’s “definitely adult content” and I look at the “neutral” score to know if the image is “Definitely safe Content.”", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/157554525b087b281e906622c27e8aba40b52c329e4ec91a2f5d153d002ac284.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.9], [5, 1.36, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 2.06], [8, 2.06, 2.52], [10, 3.02, 3.54], [12, 3.86, 4.38], [13, 4.38, 4.76], [14, 4.76, 5.12], [15, 5.12, 5.36], [16, 5.36, 5.58], [17, 5.58, 5.9], [18, 5.9, 6.28], [19, 6.28, 6.84], [20, 7.34, 7.52], [21, 7.52, 7.62], [22, 7.62, 7.78], [23, 7.78, 7.9], [24, 7.9, 8.04], [25, 8.04, 8.3], [26, 8.3, 8.68], [27, 8.68, 8.9], [28, 8.9, 9.06], [29, 9.06, 9.22], [30, 9.22, 9.3], [31, 9.3, 9.52], [32, 9.52, 9.84], [33, 9.84, 10.2], [34, 10.2, 10.62], [35, 10.62, 11.04]]}, {"text": "Quick Start", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ebd61eb127ef3870efb08156d7dfdc83bec092e06b0598c8101109a3336d0974.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.58]]}, {"text": "Self-hosting and using only takes a couple of hours since the API is so simple and Digital Ocean’s App Platform allows for Heroku-like deployment.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/0ec5a09f8fbf6f39e319e9835e9ad91c9ceb1974cc9b8b50997da0c6965118c0.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.78, 0.98], [2, 0.98, 1.18], [3, 1.18, 1.54], [4, 1.54, 1.88], [5, 1.88, 2.02], [6, 2.02, 2.24], [7, 2.24, 2.44], [8, 2.44, 2.7], [9, 2.7, 3.08], [10, 3.08, 3.28], [11, 3.28, 3.58], [12, 3.58, 3.88], [13, 3.88, 4.04], [14, 4.04, 4.52], [15, 4.52, 5.22], [16, 5.22, 5.64], [17, 5.64, 6.08], [18, 6.08, 6.4], [19, 6.4, 6.96], [20, 6.96, 7.36], [21, 7.36, 7.68], [23, 8.42, 8.88]]}, {"text": "Flask API", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4fbbe25d9ece7cf3e08bb7bdd1f52a5abc76565fe075d7e60174c31d5fc4c1ff.mp3"}, {"text": "You will need to develop your client, but there are only 2 HTTP endpoints you would need to implement: POST /predict and GET /health", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/bf58a27d0372bc20881d75fdb40311fa590e1351d40dea5622869e33e4e69413.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.44], [3, 0.44, 0.6], [4, 0.6, 0.86], [5, 0.86, 1.1], [6, 1.1, 1.46], [7, 1.82, 1.94], [8, 1.94, 2.1], [9, 2.1, 2.24], [10, 2.24, 2.44], [13, 3.4, 3.88], [14, 3.88, 4.14], [15, 4.14, 4.24], [16, 4.24, 4.36], [17, 4.36, 4.5], [18, 4.5, 4.9], [20, 6.26, 6.66], [21, 6.66, 7.2], [23, 7.96, 8.24]]}, {"text": "POST /predict", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8120fdd07820e9a2e7f487d72c11abd478417258d2a5325de0df0bcf562f0de3.mp3"}, {"text": "The service accepts a URL of an image to fetch and process.", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/42d61f5adff37eff5e441cfc04be9e0534a1320bf5576f64df36456b33687afd.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.7], [6, 1.7, 1.78], [7, 1.78, 2.02], [8, 2.02, 2.24], [9, 2.24, 2.48], [10, 2.48, 2.68], [11, 2.68, 3.06]]}, {"text": "Instead of passing the image bytes directly, the URL reduces the workload on the client and avoids the overhead of base64 encoding images for the transfer (base64 has a ~33% worse space overhead).", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/82a165d49bc6652c3fe6010695cb6cbc16f89b5a26f684e5d5d510c5a12dd157.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.44], [1, 0.44, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.94], [3, 0.94, 1.16], [4, 1.16, 1.38], [5, 1.38, 1.7], [6, 1.7, 2.26], [7, 2.68, 2.76], [8, 2.76, 3.0], [9, 3.0, 3.62], [10, 3.62, 3.84], [11, 3.84, 4.14], [12, 4.14, 4.36], [13, 4.36, 4.46], [14, 4.46, 4.8], [15, 4.8, 5.14], [16, 5.14, 5.54], [17, 5.54, 5.68], [18, 5.68, 6.08], [19, 6.08, 6.3], [20, 6.3, 6.98], [21, 6.98, 7.46], [22, 7.46, 7.88], [23, 7.88, 8.14], [24, 8.14, 8.28], [25, 8.28, 8.7], [26, 9.58, 10.26], [27, 10.26, 10.6], [28, 10.6, 10.72], [29, 10.72, 11.1], [32, 12.04, 12.56]]}, {"text": "GET /health", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/960e3b0620e05e98a82fec8da887177bb3d0a7985f75df44c99ff645c5bdbfa5.mp3"}, {"text": "The health endpoint helps you monitor if the service is running without needing to process an image.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c1b54dcab58cf5ab45fc17527219d1e197a00f39169f0e835ca2f13636386295.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.1], [4, 1.1, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.62], [6, 1.62, 1.94], [7, 1.94, 2.06], [8, 2.06, 2.3], [9, 2.3, 2.5], [10, 2.5, 2.66], [11, 2.66, 3.0], [12, 3.0, 3.28], [13, 3.28, 3.46], [14, 3.46, 3.78], [15, 3.78, 4.0], [16, 4.0, 4.28]]}, {"text": "Hosting ML microservices", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c044a8aa0b83f5bf57bfa6d7ad7f1c70b9b3b65cdaa28db3e19362af6d5e68a5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.48], [1, 0.48, 0.7], [2, 0.7, 1.42]]}, {"text": "Heroku", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e73b9f0b422a79e09d010577be3d5e785e1bc6f4aae0a38861b7f8036eaa5c2e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.48]]}, {"text": "Unfortunately, Heroku limits the slug size to 500MB.", "block": 25, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c1d9bd538a55893ada8233c057e1b9a69480cd6c38229e19e619de6f890882c0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.68], [1, 0.86, 1.18], [2, 1.18, 1.46], [3, 1.46, 1.76], [4, 1.76, 1.98], [5, 1.98, 2.2], [6, 2.2, 2.42], [7, 2.42, 3.18]]}, {"text": "After compilation, the flask app is 635MB (due to needing to load the ML model (250MB) and PyTorch.", "block": 25, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6bd905f4eb36a459b4cf1c00ef29b7b68d524bad361f3494b4fd3eec6c26214b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.84], [2, 0.84, 1.16], [3, 1.16, 1.52], [4, 1.52, 1.66], [5, 1.66, 1.8], [6, 1.8, 2.8], [7, 2.8, 3.48], [8, 3.48, 3.62], [9, 3.62, 3.8], [10, 3.8, 4.06], [11, 4.06, 4.26], [12, 4.26, 4.44], [13, 4.44, 4.66], [14, 4.66, 5.0], [15, 5.0, 6.26], [16, 6.26, 6.54], [17, 6.54, 7.1]]}, {"text": "It is impossible to host ML services on Heroku.", "block": 25, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1b32d9360b4dfc62109939f9f70e84697239cd1b42622fa7585d8f905ed80e56.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.72], [3, 0.72, 0.96], [4, 0.96, 1.24], [6, 1.48, 1.84], [7, 1.84, 2.14], [8, 2.14, 2.56]]}, {"text": "Digital Ocean", "block": 26, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1b93f62fc4e2f526fffc51eb1c5cf3a2f4280b777618452a63054987b9aaf01a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.82]]}, {"text": "The $10/mo Digital Ocean 1GB/1vCPU App Platform hosts this project perfectly.", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1bce6bd979b0b7c08f8afbf76b57e683ff8e22a49999d05fd3d017f4ce9b86f6.mp3"}, {"text": "The first deployment takes 20+ minutes, but it will eventually startup.", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/26bf551fe23241ef011bd1fcfec2db53e1cd904c92f86f43ef882caae136d2d2.mp3"}, {"text": "There is a health check endpoint at /health where you can verify the service is running.", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/03a7e61e9494998aa9e54ca48fbf17044e1f4679bfbbd3ac9c0c696fb44a9aa9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.46], [3, 0.46, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 1.0], [6, 1.52, 1.8], [7, 2.2, 3.0], [8, 3.0, 3.36], [9, 3.36, 3.48], [10, 3.48, 3.62], [11, 3.62, 3.92], [12, 3.92, 4.22], [13, 4.22, 4.54], [14, 4.54, 4.72], [15, 4.72, 4.96]]}, {"text": "This machine takes about 600ms per request and has 2 workers, so can take about 0.8 requests per second or 72,000 images per day.", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/24401c839eed4c8980e1d3fbcbee93ff8fbf4eefbea05fd4580a8759dc5c7392.mp3"}, {"text": "Not too shabby for a $10/mo ML microservice.", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/0e9d119ce59ed749858f2d6f363f4e1e4eabe5c4ec4922f18700b9938af9d6b7.mp3"}, {"text": "Sample App config", "block": 29, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/98a2fb1b062d901640fa0c76c2a08cf0b80bf7ca0764040a6850a0d5c7920cf6.mp3"}, {"text": "Special Thanks", "block": 30, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/70f4b34795d70ce814003afbee8e26dacfaca3ec9a0b55768e0b887965b0633c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.78]]}, {"text": "The flask service is a wrapper for the GantMan/nsfw_model.", "block": 31, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e83a2f3d2ea90c38e535427289faf0eebea25ede0803b296d51d793ced003047.mp3"}, {"text": "They performed the heavy lift of developing the ML model and the prediction code.", "block": 31, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a5fe0f4fd813cce47c437f7eb6aeee275941cbee566aeb04e51a5bc3694dc3d1.mp3"}, {"text": "You can play with a web host version of the model on nsfwjs.com since we use the same model.", "block": 32, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b668729c154ba32950d7e62c71b5e188ab782406210696545558f2c3b4c5fc97.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.26], [2, 0.26, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.72], [5, 0.86, 1.04], [6, 1.04, 1.32], [7, 1.32, 1.7], [8, 1.7, 1.84], [9, 1.84, 1.96], [10, 1.96, 2.22], [11, 2.22, 2.5], [13, 4.06, 4.32], [14, 4.32, 4.5], [15, 4.5, 4.66], [16, 4.66, 4.84], [17, 4.84, 5.04], [18, 5.04, 5.38]]}]}